\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Jesus comes with all His grace,
\par Comes to save a fallen race;
\par Object of our glorious hope,
\par Jesus comes to lift us up.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Let the living stones cry out;
\par Let the sons of Abraham shout;
\par Praise we all our lowly King,
\par Give Him thanks, rejoice, and sing.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. He hath our salvation wrought,
\par He our captive souls hath bought,
\par He hath reconciled to God,
\par He hath washed us in His blood.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. We are now His lawful right,
\par Walk as children of the light;
\par We shall soon obtain the grace,
\par Pure in heart, to see His face.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. We shall gain our calling's prize;
\par After God we all shall rise,
\par Filled with joy, and love, and peace,
\par Perfected in holiness.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

